---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Swimming Pool"
  description="The Dartington community swimming pool — built by volunteers in 1975, closed since 2022, and on the road to being rebuilt."
  ogImage="/images/facilities/pool-og.jpg"
  bodyClass="zone-pool"
>

  <section class="mw-zone-hero">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <span class="mw-eyebrow">Community facility</span>
      <h1>Swimming Pool</h1>
      <p>Built by the community in 1975. Being rebuilt by it again.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE OLD POOL -->
  <section class="mw-sect" style="background: var(--bg-elevated);">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <div class="pool-intro">
        <span class="mw-eyebrow">Our history</span>
        <h2>A pool built by the community, for the community</h2>
        <p class="pool-lead">Dartington Swimming Pool was built by volunteers from the local community over a couple of summers in 1975 and 1976. The playground mounds nearby are partly made from the earth that was excavated to build it.</p>
        <p>Since then it has been a thriving hub, with many local families having generations learn to swim here. It is, in every sense, a pool that has been run by the community for the community.</p>
        <p>Sadly, over the summer of 2022 the liner badly tore and exposed the rotten underlying structure. The pool was unable to open in its current state and has remained closed since. But the community that built this pool has every intention of building it back.</p>
        <p><a href="/documents/Pool-Build-Booklet.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read this booklet about the origional build &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pool-photo-grid">
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/IMG_3157.JPG" alt="The old Dartington swimming pool" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/Photo 02-07-2019, 09 03 55.jpg" alt="Swimming at Dartington" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/287502301_3160188130886595_8149523453936601776_n.jpg" alt="Community swimming at Dartington" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/109802155_626516214633831_5742729953052308489_n.jpg" alt="Dartington pool" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/109808089_367489647565643_2624982532694716731_n.jpg" alt="Dartington pool" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/OLD PHOTOS.jpg" alt="Dartington pool archive" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE JOURNEY -->
  <section class="mw-sect">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <span class="mw-eyebrow">Progress</span>
      <h2>The journey so far</h2>
      <p style="max-width: 60ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-7);">In 2020, a small group of volunteers began thinking about what a pool refurbishment could look like. After consulting 235 local households, researching pool standards and working with architects, here is where we have got to.</p>
      <div class="pool-milestones">
        <div class="pool-milestone">
          <span class="pool-milestone-year">2020</span>
          <div class="pool-milestone-body">
            <strong>Volunteers get to work</strong>
            <p>A working party forms, consults 235 households, engages schools and user groups, and commissions <a href="https://www.akirbyarchitects.com">Andrew Kirby Architects</a> for the pre-planning application.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pool-milestone">
          <span class="pool-milestone-year">2022</span>
          <div class="pool-milestone-body">
            <strong>Pool closes</strong>
            <p>Liner failure exposes the rotten underlying structure. The pool closes. Fundraising and planning work intensifies.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pool-milestone">
          <span class="pool-milestone-year">2022&ndash;24</span>
          <div class="pool-milestone-body">
            <strong>Fundraising</strong>
            <p>Significant funds raised through grants, community contributions and generous supporters, including Gibbons Trust, The Normans Family Charity Trust, South West Water and Thrive.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pool-milestone pool-milestone--now">
          <span class="pool-milestone-year">Feb 2025</span>
          <div class="pool-milestone-body">
            <strong>Planning permission granted</strong>
            <p>Full planning permission secured for the new pool. We are now gathering contractor quotes and building the project plan to take us from drawings to reality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GET INVOLVED -->
  <section class="mw-sect" style="background: var(--bg-elevated);">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <div class="mw-banner">
        <div>
          <span class="mw-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Get involved</span>
          <h3>Can you help?</h3>
          <p>This pool was built by volunteers and it will be rebuilt by them too, but we need more hands. We are particularly looking for people with skills in construction and the trades, project management, business planning, fundraising, accountancy, communications and social media. But enthusiasm and time are just as valuable. If you care about this pool, we want to hear from you.</p>
          <p>We hold a weekly pool meeting (in person and on Zoom) and new faces are always welcome. Or if you would prefer a more casual introduction, come and find us at <a href="/events">one of our events</a>.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="mw-btn mw-btn-ink">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
        <div class="visual" style="background-image: url('/images/facilities/pool/old-pool/IMG_3157.JPG');"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE NEW POOL -->
  <section class="mw-sect tall">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <span class="mw-eyebrow">Looking forward</span>
      <h2>Plans for the new pool</h2>
      <div class="pool-plans">
        <div class="pool-plans-text">
          <p>The designs have been shaped by years of consultation with the community and key user groups including local schools, Totnes Sub Aqua Club, Bidwell Brook, Lifeworks and Robins. Inclusivity, sustainability and the environment are at the heart of everything.</p>
          <p>Early estimates put the total project cost at around &pound;1m. Thanks to Section 106 funding and our fundraising work we have made a good start, but there is a long way to go and every contribution matters.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>25-metre swim lanes:</strong>extended to allow proper lengths for serious swimmers</li>
            <li><strong>Warm water:</strong>heated by air source heat pumps powered by solar PV on the pavilion roof, with batteries to maximise the energy generated. <a href="/energy-hub">Read more about our energy systems &rarr;</a></li>
            <li><strong>Extended season:</strong>open into September for school lessons and beyond</li>
            <li><strong>Improved shallow end:</strong>wide corner steps for families with young children and easier access for everyone</li>
            <li><strong>Full accessible access:</strong>especially important for Bidwell Brook, Lifeworks and Robins</li>
            <li><strong>Sub-aqua ready:</strong>a thicker liner so Totnes Sub Aqua Club can use their equipment safely</li>
            <li><strong>Modern changing facilities:</strong>non-gendered changing including accessible and family cubicles</li>
            <li><strong>Sustainable build:</strong>excavated earth used to create a Devon bank, UV filtration and automatic dosing to minimise chemical use</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/documents/pool-Prospectus-Final.pdf" class="mw-btn mw-btn-ink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the prospectus</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pool-renders">
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/Image1.png.webp" alt="Render of the new Dartington swimming pool" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/Image5.png.webp" alt="Render of the new pool pavilion" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/Image7.png.webp" alt="New pool render" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/Image8.png.webp" alt="New pool render" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/Image9.png.webp" alt="New pool render, aerial view" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/facilities/pool/renders-of-new-pool/plan.webp" alt="New pool plan view" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mw-sect tight">
    <div class="mw-wrap">
      <a href="/facilities" class="mw-back">Back to all facilities</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ---- Intro ---- */
  .pool-intro {
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .pool-intro h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  .pool-intro .mw-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .pool-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .pool-intro p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  /* ---- Old pool photo grid ---- */
  .pool-photo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .pool-photo-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    display: block;
  }

  /* ---- Journey section headings ---- */
  section .mw-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ---- Milestones ---- */
  .pool-milestones {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .pool-milestone {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .pool-milestone-year {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .pool-milestone--now .pool-milestone-year {
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .pool-milestone-body strong {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .pool-milestone-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- New pool plans ---- */
  .pool-plans {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .pool-plans-text p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 55ch;
  }
  .pool-plans-text ul {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .pool-plans-text li {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .pool-plans-text a:not(.mw-btn) {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  .pool-renders {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .pool-renders img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    display: block;
  }
  .pool-renders img:first-child {
    grid-column: span 2;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
  }

  /* ---- Responsive ---- */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .pool-photo-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .pool-milestones { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .pool-plans { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pool-renders img:first-child { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .pool-photo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pool-milestones { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pool-renders { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pool-renders img:first-child { grid-column: span 1; }
  }
</style>
